    "Address: 153 Dong Da, Hai Chau Ward, Da Nang City, Vietnam",
    "Email: user@example.com",
    "You may register yourself to create a trial workspace, or be granted an account by your company's HR/administrator.",
    "You may log in with an email and password or with a Google account. When using Google sign-in, you also agree to comply with Google's terms of service.",
    "Registration information must be accurate, complete, and kept up to date whenever it changes.",
    "You are responsible for keeping your login credentials secure and for all activity arising from your account; notify us immediately if you discover unauthorized access.",
    "Users must be 18 years of age or older.",
    "New workspaces receive a free trial for the period announced at the time of registration.",
    "After the trial period, continued use requires a service contract between the business and Avoca AI JSC. Pricing and the number of seats are agreed on a case-by-case basis.",
    "Accounts are only fully activated once the contract takes effect and payment is completed.",
    "Fees paid are non-refundable, unless otherwise agreed in writing in the contract.",
    "If the number of seats under the contract is exceeded, the system will restrict the creation of additional accounts.",
    "When using the Service, you agree NOT to:",
    "Share your account or use another person's account.",
    "Cheat on assessments, copy answers, or have someone else study or take tests on your behalf.",
    "Copy, download, redistribute, or commercialize course content outside your organization without our prior written permission.",
    "Interfere with, scan, attack, reverse-engineer, or disrupt the operation of the system.",
    "Upload content that violates the law, infringes third-party rights, or contains malicious code.",
    "Use the Service to send spam or collect data without authorization.",
    "The AI Appstore showcases third-party AI applications; some links may be affiliate links. We do not control and are not responsible for the content, quality, or policies of those services.",
    "We strive to keep the Service running reliably but do not guarantee uninterrupted operation; periodic maintenance may occur and will be announced in advance when feasible."
